<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam inflation ends year at six-month high.</title>
<headline>Vietnam inflation ends year at six-month high.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's General Statistics Office issued the following economic indicators on Thursday:</p>
<p> VIETNAM CONSUMER PRICES		Dec 96     Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month percentage change    +1.0	 +0.9	 +0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year percentage change	+4.5	 +3.8	+12.7</p>
<p> Index base (base 100 = prev. Dec)  104.5	103.5	112.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Year-on-year inflation was at its highest level since last June.</p>
</text>
